return ['domain'=>'zinn-translate','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'so_SO','project-id-version'=>'zinn-translate','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-08T11:06:41+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-08T11:06:41+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Translate'=>'Zinn® Translate','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-translate'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-translate','Publishes this site in every language you choose, on its own web addresses, with translated slugs, metadata, menus, WooCommerce products, hreflang, per-language sitemaps and llms.txt. Translate with your Zinn Digital® plan or with your own provider key.'=>'Wuxuu boggan ku daabacaa luqad kasta oo aad doorato, ciwaannada mareegaha ee u gaarka ah, oo wata slug-yada la turjumay, metadata, liiska xulashada, alaabta WooCommerce, hreflang, sitemap-yada luqad kasta ah iyo llms.txt. Ku turjun qorshahaaga Zinn Digital® ama furahaaga bixiyaha.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Translate'=>'Turjun','Manual overrides'=>'Kacsashooyinka gacanta','Sitemaps and URLs'=>'Khariidadaha bogagga iyo URLs','General'=>'Guud ahaan','Who pays for the translation'=>'Yaa bixiya kharashka turjumaadda','Either your Zinn Digital® plan, or an API key of your own. There is no free tier — somebody pays a provider for every word.'=>'Mid kasta oo ka mid ah qorshahaaga Zinn Digital®, ama furahaaga API gaarka ah. Ma jiro heer bilaash ah — qof ayaa bixiya lacagta bixiyaha eray kasta.','My Zinn Digital® plan'=>'Qorshahayga Zinn Digital®','My own provider key'=>'Furaha key-ga bixiyaha aniga leh','Site ID'=>'Goobaha ID','From your Zinn Digital® dashboard, on this site\'s Translation tab.'=>'Laga soo bilaabo sabuuraddaada Zinn Digital®, tab-ka Turjumaadda ee bishan.','Site token'=>'Astaan ​​goobta','Provider'=>'Bixiyaha','API key'=>'Furaha API','Your key, billed to you by the provider. It is stored on this site and sent only to them.'=>'Furahaaga, kaas oo bixiyahaagu kugu billaynayo. Waxa lagu kaydiyaa boggan waxaana loo diraa iyaga keliya.','Model'=>'Habka','Leave empty for the cheapest model that does the job well.'=>'Si aad u hesho nooca ugu jaban ee shaqada si fiican u qabta, meesha bannaan kaga tag.','This site is written in'=>'Boggan waxaa ku qoran','Leave empty to use the site language from WordPress settings.'=>'Ka tag faaruq si aad u isticmaasho luqadda mareegta ee ka timid dejinta WordPress.','Languages to publish'=>'Luuqadaha la daabacayo','Each one gets its own web addresses and its own sitemap. Publish only the languages you want indexed.'=>'Mid kastaa wuxuu helayaa cinwaankiisa shabakadda iyo khariidaddiisa shabakadda. Daabac kaliya luqadaha aad rabto in la indeks gareeyo.','Translate automatically when I publish or update'=>'Turjun si otomaat ah marka aan daabaco ama cusboonaysiiyo','Editing a page marks its translations out of date and they are remade in the background. Editing without changing any words costs nothing.'=>'Tifatirka boggu wuxuu calaamadeynayaa turjumaadaheeda kuwo duugowday waxaana dib loogu sameeyaa asalka. Tifatirka adiga oo aan wax eray ah bedelin wax kharash ah ma laha.','What gets translated'=>'Waxa la turjumo','Post types'=>'Noocyada qoraalka','Translate the web addresses too'=>'Cinwaanada shabakadda sidoo kale tarjuma','French visitors get /fr/a-propos/ rather than /fr/about/. The untranslated address keeps working and redirects, so nothing that was indexed breaks.'=>'Booqdayeyaasha Faransiisku waxay helayaan /fr/a-propos/ halkii ay ka heli lahaayeen /fr/about/. Cinwaanka aan la turjumin waa uu sii shaqaynayaa oo wuxuu sameeyaa hagid, sidaa darteed wax walba oo la indexing gareeyay ma jabayaan.','Translate SEO titles, descriptions and image alt text'=>'Turjun cinwaannada SEO-ga, sharraxaadaha iyo qoraalka beddelka sawirka (alt text)','Translate categories and tags'=>'Turjun qaybaha iyo sumadaha','Translate navigation menus'=>'Turjun menu-yada navigation-ka','Translate WooCommerce products and attributes'=>'Turjumi alaabta iyo sifooyinka WooCommerce','Short descriptions, purchase notes, attribute labels and variation descriptions. Prices, SKUs and stored option values are never touched.'=>'Sharaxaadaha gaaban, qoraalada iibsashada, calaamadaha sifooyinka, iyo sharaxaadaha kala duwanaanshaha. Qiimaha, SKU-yada iyo qiyamka ikhtiyaarka ah ee la kaydiyay weligood lama taabto.','SEO'=>'SEO','Add hreflang tags'=>'Ku dar calaamadaha hreflang','Tells search engines these pages are the same page in different languages. Leave this on unless another plugin is already doing it.'=>'Waxay u sheegtaa mashiinnada raadinta in bogaggani ay yihiin isku bog oo luqado kala duwan ah. Daar tan illaa iyo inta uu plugin kale hore u samaynayo.','Publish a sitemap for each language'=>'Daabaco khariidadda mareegaha ee luqad kasta','Publish llms.txt for each language'=>'Daabac llms.txt luqad kasta','A plain-text map of the site that AI answer engines read. They often cannot run JavaScript and may never fetch a sitemap.'=>'Khariidadda qoraal-gacmeedka ah ee goobta taas oo ay akhriyaan mashiinnada jawaabaha ee AI. Inta badan ma wadi karaan JavaScript waxaana laga yaabaa inaysan waligood soo qaadan khariidadda goobta (sitemap).','Language switcher'=>'Beddelaha luqadda','Style'=>'Habka','Colours, spacing and corners are on the Styling tab. Place it with the block, the [zinn_language_switcher] shortcode, or a menu.'=>'Midabada, bannaaneynta iyo geesaha waxay ku jiraan tabka Habaynta (Styling). Ku rid block-ka, [zinn_language_switcher] shortcode, ama menu.','Show only these languages'=>'Muuji kaliya luqadahan','Leave empty to show every language you publish.'=>'Ka tag madhan si aad u tusto luqad kasta oo aad daabacdo.','Name each language in its own language'=>'Luqad kasta ugu magacow luqaddeeda','Deutsch rather than German. Somebody who cannot read the current page cannot read "German" either.'=>'Deutsch halkii ay ahaan lahayd German. Qof aan akhrisan karin bogga hadda socda ma akhrisan karo "German" sidoo kale.','Show flags'=>'Tus calammada','Off by default: a language is not a country, and Arabic and Spanish have no single flag that does not exclude most of their speakers.'=>'Waa damisan yahay asal ahaan: luqad ma aha waddan, Carabi iyo Isbaanish ma laha hal calan oo aan ka reebin inta badan dadka ku hadla.','Include the language being read'=>'Ku dar luqadda la akhrinayo','Include the original language'=>'Ku dar luqaddii asal ahayd','Add it to this menu'=>'Ku dar liiskan','Only the menu you name here. Nothing is added to any other menu on the site.'=>'Kaliya menu-ga aad halkan ku magacowdo. Wax aan ahayn ayaa lagu darayaa menu kasta oo kale oo ku yaal bogga.','Accent'=>'Accent','Background'=>'Asalra','Text'=>'Qoraal','Corner radius'=>'Geeska wareegga','Spacing'=>'Masaafada','Text size'=>'Cabbirka qoraalka','Do not add it to a menu'=>'Ha ku darin liiska muujinta','Edit any translation here. An edited translation is kept exactly as you wrote it and is never overwritten when the page is translated again.'=>'Halkan ku tasi sax kasta oo turjumaad ah. Turjumaad la saxay waxaa loo hayaa sida aad u qortay oo kale soona mar dambe lama dul qoro marka bogga dib loo turjumo.','Every language'=>'Kasta oo ka mid ah luqadaha','Search translations'=>'Raadi tarjumaadaha','Filter'=>'Sifee','Content'=>'Wax ka kooban','Language'=>'Luqadda','Translation'=>'Turjumaad','Status'=>'Xaaladda','Save'=>'Kaydi','Nothing translated yet. Publish a language and translation starts in the background.'=>'Wax tarjuman ah oo la helay ma jiraan. Daabac luqad oo tarjumontu waxay ka bilaabanaysaa gadaal (background).','These addresses are live. Open any of them to check it, and submit the sitemap index to Google Search Console.'=>'Ciwaanradani waa kuwo toos ah. Fur midkood in kasta oo aad hubiso, oo u gudbi tusmada khariidadda goobta Google Search Console.','You are not allowed to edit translations on this site.'=>'Looma ogola inaad wax ka beddesho turjumaadaha boggan.','Edited by you — kept'=>'Waxaa tafatiray adiga — la haystay','Source changed — will be redone'=>'Isha waa la beddelay - waa la dib u samayn doonaa','Up to date'=>'Casriyay','Zinn®'=>'Zinn®','Who pays'=>'Yaa bixiya','Comma separated, for example: fr, de, ar'=>'Comma separated, tusaale ahaan: fr, de, ar','Switcher style'=>'Habka beddelaha','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — hagayaasha iyo adeegyada','User guides'=>'Hagaha isticmaalaha','Read the %s user guide'=>'Akhri hagaha isticmaalaha %s','Hide this'=>'Qari tan','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Haye\'inta Zinn® ee WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, kaydinta maalinlaha ah, haajiradda bilaashka ah iyo guddiga kontoroolka ee loogu talagalay dadka wada in ka badan hal degel.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Suuqa Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Iibso oo iibi mareegaha, domain-yada iyo meelaha xiriirinta ee dhisనూ, iyadoo lacagta si ammaan ah loo haynayo ilaa labada dhinac ay ka qanacayaan.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — kireyso dadkan u shaqaysta xirfad ahaan','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Suuqa kala iibsiga ee xorta ah ee caalamiga ah: ka dhex raadi in ka badan 10,000 adeeg oo diyaar ah oo ka yimid qorayaasha, naqshadeeyayaasha, horumariyeyaasha iyo khuburada SEO, ama soo dhig mashruuc oo u ogolow inay ku tartamaan.','The API key was rejected. Check that it is still valid and has translation access, then save it again.'=>'Furaha API waa la diiday. Hubi inuu weli shaqeynayo oo uu leeyahay ogolaanshaha tarjumaadda, kadibna dib u kaydi.','The provider refused on billing or quota. Nothing was translated. Check the balance and limits on your account with them.'=>'Bixiyaha ayaa diiday biilasha ama xaddiga. Wax lama turjumin. Ka hubi hadhaaga iyo xadka koontadaada iyaga.','The translation provider is having a problem at their end. Nothing was translated or charged, and it will try again on the next pass.'=>'Bixiyaha turjumaaddu wuxuu dhibaato ku qaba dhiniciisa. Wax lama turjumin sidoo kale lacag lagama jarin, waxaana la isku dayi doonaa markale marba marka xigta.','The translation request failed and we could not tell why. Nothing was saved.'=>'Codsiga turjumiddu wuu guuldarraystay mana aanu garan karin sababta. Waxba lama kaydin.','Sitemap index'=>'Tusaha degelka','%s sitemap'=>'%s khariidadda mareegta','LLM content map'=>'Khariidadda nuxurka LLM','%s LLM content map'=>'%s Khariidadda nuxurka LLM','Languages published'=>'Luuqadaha la daabacay','Site language'=>'Luqadda bogga','SEO plugin'=>'Soodhweeyaha SEO','No translation provider is set up yet.'=>'Weli lama dejin wax bixiyaha turjumaadda.','Paste an API key from your chosen provider, or connect the site to a Zinn Digital® account, and translation starts on the next pass.'=>'Geli furaha API ee bixiyaha aad dooratay, ama ku xidh bogga koontada Zinn Digital®, oo turjumaaddu waxay bilaabanaysaa wareegga xiga.','Translating with your own %s key.'=>'Turjumidda adigoo isticmaalaya furahaaga %s.','This site is not connected to a Zinn Digital® account, which is fine — your provider bills you directly.'=>'Boggan kuma xidhna koontada Zinn Digital®, taas oo fiican - bixiyahaagu si toos ah ayuu kaaga soo bill-gareeyaa.','Not connected to Zinn Digital® yet.'=>'Weliba kuma xidhna Zinn Digital®.','Add this site\'s ID and token from your Zinn Digital® dashboard, or switch to your own provider key to run without an account.'=>'Ku dar aqoonsiga iyo sumadda boggan ee laga helo golahaaga kontoroolka ee Zinn Digital®, ama u beddel furahaaga bixiyaha adiga kuu gaar ah si aad u shaqeyso adigoo aan lahayn akoon.','Connected to Zinn Digital®.'=>'Waxaa ku xiran Zinn Digital®.','The translation provider is having a problem.'=>'Bixiyaha turjumaaddu wuxuu qabaa dhibaato.','Translation is paused — your provider needs attention.'=>'Turjumaaddu way hakatay — bixiyahaaga ayaa u baahan in la eego.','Translation has not been set up yet.'=>'Tarjumaadda lama dejinin weli.','Something went wrong at our end.'=>'Wax khaldan ayaa ka dhacay dhinaceenna.','Check their status page'=>'Hubi boggoodooda xaaladda','Fix this on your account'=>'Tan ku hagaaji akoonkaaga','Zinn® language switcher'=>'Zinn® luqadaha beddeleha','Let visitors read this page in another language.'=>'U ogolow booqdayeyaashu inay boggan ku akhriyaan luqad kale.','Title'=>'Ciwaan','Use the plugin setting'=>'Isticmaal habaynta furaha','Dropdown'=>'Soojeedinta hoos-u-dhaca','Inline list'=>'Liiska dhex-dhiska ah','Pills'=>'Kiniiniyada','Minimal text'=>'Qoraal yar','Flags and names'=>'Calanka iyo magacyada','Stacked list'=>'Liiska la dul-saaray','Choose a language'=>'Dooro luuqad','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Fiiri qoraallada sii-daynta ee Zinn Digital®.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Cusboonaysiintii la soo dejiyey ayaa ku guuldareysatay baaritaanka hufnaanta waxaana la rakibay.','No DeepL API key is saved, so there is nothing to translate with.'=>'Ma jiro DeepL API key ah oo la keydiyay, markaa ma jiro wax lagu turjumo.','DeepL does not translate into %s. Choose Google Gemini or OpenAI for this language, or connect the site to Zinn Digital®.'=>'DeepL uma turjumto %s. Dooro Google Gemini ё OpenAI luqaddan, ama ku xidh bogga Zinn Digital®.','DeepL could not be reached. Nothing was translated and nothing was charged; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'DeepL lama gaari karin. Wax tarjumaad ah lama samayn wax lacag ahna lagama jarin; waxay isku dayi doontaa mar labaad mararka xiga.','Your DeepL character quota is used up for this period. Translation resumes when it resets, or when you raise the limit on your DeepL account.'=>'DeepL xarfahaaga loo qoondeeyay ayaa ka dhammaaday muddadan. Turjumaaddu waxay dib u bilaaban doontaa marka la cusboonaysiiyo, ama marka aad kordhiso xadka koontadaada DeepL.','DeepL answered with something we could not read. Nothing was saved.'=>'DeepL waxay ku jawaabtay shay aan akhriyi karaynay. Wax lama kaydin.','No Google Gemini API key is saved, so there is nothing to translate with.'=>'Ma jiro wax furaha API ee Google Gemini ah oo la keydiyay, markaa ma jirto wax lagu turjumo.','Google Gemini could not be reached. Nothing was translated and nothing was charged; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'Google Gemini waa la gaari waayay. Wax tarjumaad ah lama samayn wax lacag ahna lama qaadin; waxay isku dayi doontaa mar labaad mararka xiga.','No OpenAI API key is saved, so there is nothing to translate with.'=>'Ma jiro fure OpenAI API ah oo la kaydiyay, markaa ma jiro wax lagu turjumo.','OpenAI could not be reached. Nothing was translated and nothing was charged; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'OpenAI lama soo xiriiri karo. Wax tarjumaad ah lama samayn wax kharash ahna lagama jarin; waxay isku dayi doontaa mar labaad wareegga xiga.','This site is not connected to Zinn Digital®, so there is nothing to collect. Add the Site ID and token, or switch to your own provider key.'=>'Boggan kuma xirna Zinn Digital®, markaas ma jiraan wax la ururiyo. Ku dar aqoonsiga Mareegta (Site ID) iyo calaamadda (token), ama u beddel furahaaga bixiyahaaga.','This site is not connected to Zinn Digital®.'=>'Webkaani kuma xirna Zinn Digital®.','Zinn Digital® could not be reached. Nothing was sent; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'Zinn Digital® lama gaari karin. Waxba lama dirin; waxay isku dayi doontaa mar labaad mararka xiga.','Translation is paused on this site. Check the account is up to date on your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'Turjumaaddu waa ay hakin tahay bishan. Hubi in koontadaadu ay tahay mid casri ah oo ku taal golahaaga maamulka ee Zinn Digital®.','Zinn Digital® rejected this site\'s token. Copy it again from the site\'s Translation tab on your dashboard.'=>'Zinn Digital® waxay diiday summada boggan. Ka soo guuri mar kale tab-ka Turjumaada ee bogga laga helo dashboard-kaaga.','Zinn Digital® could not be reached. Your site keeps serving the translations it already has.'=>'Zinn Digital® lama gaari karo. Mareegahaagu wuxuu sii wadaa bixinta turjumaadaha uu hore u haystay.','Zinn Digital® answered with something we could not read. Your site keeps serving the translations it already has.'=>'Zinn Digital® waxay ku jawaabtay shay aan akhriyi kari weynay. Boggaagu wuxuu sii wadaa bixinta turjumaadaha uu horay u haystay.']];